Package: com.adam.livingiconsdumper
Name: LivingIcons Dumper
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Exports rendered SpringBoard app icons and bundle identifiers for LivingIcons themes. Install tweak, go to each page of your home screen, stay for about 5 seconds. When you're done, your app icons save to the /var/mobile/Library/Documents/LivingIconsDump/ folder. Animate those icons, go to LivingIcons app settings, and override an app to your liking.
